      "id": 227854,
      "name": "kamesenin888",
      "username": "kamesenin888",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/5f9b8f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-06-25T18:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://imgur.com/KpUMVRg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">outcome</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For last week my cellphone got buggy as hell and I couldnt get the mint on that one( not even fine) but for this one here is my solution, worked on steam and the cellphone(that has fine) and steam mint</p>\n<p>Initial Setup<br>\nHit Luminary</p>\n<p>Kaagra 40<br>\nDymkgarn 10<br>\nAndolin 14 Prevents 1<br>\nSsdari 12 Prevents 1<br>\nhit fanatic</p>\n<p>Turn 1<br>\nLifeline&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Play Harrow<br>\nHit Sdari, Dymkgarn and kaagra<br>\nPower to Draw and writhe draws</p>\n<p><br>\nWrithe</p>\n<p>Play FIght and fade hitting Dymkgarn<br>\nPlay Nowhere to run on sdari<br>\nPower to shuffle</p>\n<p>Comodora</p>\n<p>Play Cutlass<br>\nHit Dymkgarn, Sbari<br>\nPower on Sbari<br>\nChoose environment</p>\n<p>Fanatic</p>\n<p>Play Brutal&nbsp;<br>\nKill Sbari<br>\nPower on Dym killin her</p>\n<p>Luminary</p>\n<p>Play Sabre</p>\n<p>Power on kaargar<br>\nDo not destroy</p>\n<p>scale 7-9</p>\n<p>Turn 2</p>\n<p>Environment</p>\n<p>PLay Spy<br>\nHit Fanatic</p>\n<p><br>\nKaagra<br>\nPlay Tarnis with title increase damage<br>\nHit comodora<br>\nHit LUminary and lifeline<br>\nHit Writhe Discard SOmber</p>\n<p><br>\nScales 12 10</p>\n<p>Lifeline</p>\n<p>Play Shift for consider price<br>\nPower on writhe</p>\n<p>Writhe</p>\n<p>Play Scamancy on tardis<br>\nPlay Unnerving Target<br>\nLook Shadow Cloac<br>\nSkip Power</p>\n<p>Comodora<br>\nPlay Sweetspot<br>\nPower on kaargar<br>\nDiscard card for Kaargar<br>\nEnd of turn</p>\n<p>DO not destroy the shadow cloak hit kaargra</p>\n<p><br>\nFanatic</p>\n<p>Play Strike on andolin<br>\nSkip power</p>\n<p>Luminary</p>\n<p>Play Disposable defender&nbsp;<br>\nPower of defender choose doomsday and sabre<br>\nSabre hits kaargra and then hit kaagra destroying doomsday&nbsp;<br>\nSabre 2 hits kaagra not destroying<br>\nScales 13 12</p>\n<p>Turn 3</p>\n<p>Kaagra</p>\n<p>Plays Fickle Fans<br>\nHit Comodora<br>\nScales 9-17<br>\nHit Comodora and writhe discard tinker(preventing damage)<br>\nPlay Ashclaw&nbsp;<br>\nHit Writhe again<br>\nand the protected sabre</p>\n<p>Lifeline</p>\n<p>Play Calc Action for tech&nbsp;<br>\nPlay Unleash energy hit andolin first then the rest,&nbsp; now we need to kill kaarga<br>\nPlay Repair for comodora power for kaarga and discard a card for kaargra<br>\nVitality power on kaarga</p>\n<p>kaargra on 11</p>\n<p>Writhe</p>\n<p>Darkly Dreaming andolin first<br>\nthen destroy shadow cloak<br>\npower on trash</p>\n<p>Comodora</p>\n<p>Cannon portal<br>\nPower on kargra<br>\nPortal Damage to kargra</p>\n<p>scales 10-29</p>\n<p>GG</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
