    {
      "id": 227856,
      "name": "tedprodromou",
      "username": "tedprodromou",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-06-26T00:19:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I did a few similar practice games to get the hang of the idea, which helped. Won the game and got a&nbsp;Mint.</p>\n<p>It is not as bad as it looks, even when it looks like you are losing and hopeless!</p>\n<p>Fickle Fans really saves you: I got 10 tokens to my hero favor pool from Fickle Fans. Lifeline cann play Leyline Shift and sometimes get lucky and get Fickle Fans.</p>\n<p>Pay a lot of attention to which TItles are currently available and try to get those fast. Make sure that Lifeline doesn't get Seeker because that Title is disastrous for him. When Kaargra is out, you have to focus fire on her (or focus fire on Provocator Tarnis first if he is in your way.)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Good luck folks! This one can be done!</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:08.902Z",
